warning: `for` loop from 10 to 1 without a negative step never runs
 --> Lua54:1:1
1 | for i = 10, 1 do print(i) end
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
help: add a negative step: `for i = start, limit, -1 do`

warning: `for` loop from 16 to 1 without a negative step never runs
 --> Lua54:1:1
1 | for i = 0x10, 1 do print(i) end
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
help: add a negative step: `for i = start, limit, -1 do`

warning: `for` loop from -1 to -5 without a negative step never runs
